-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §25 מנהל חדש: a new principal is paid a
-- management allowance by his school's complexity level, the parameters
-- and the allowances to be agreed by 31.12.2011 and annexed as annex ד';
-- in a school that applies the reform in full, the Oz LaTmura supplement
-- teachers are paid, by §16; and §18 on the training allowance.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-16`
IMPORT `oz-founding-18`

§ `25 מנהל חדש`

DECLARE `Oz section 25 action` IS ONE OF
    `agree the complexity-level parameters and the principal's management allowance`

§§ `25(א)–(ב)`

-- (א): a new principal (§4(ז)) is entitled to a management allowance by
-- the complexity level set for the school he manages. (ב): the parameters
-- of the level, and the allowance for each, are for the parties to agree
-- by 5 Tevet 5772 (31.12.2011, the day included: convention dates.end),
-- the summary to be annexed as annex ד'. The agreement the corpus
-- publishes carries no annex ד' (its annexes are א'–ג', ה' and ו'): the
-- allowance is set elsewhere, and a fact of the case here.
@ref akn:art_25__para_a
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
      `the allowance annex ד' gives his school's level` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `a new principal's management allowance` m `the allowance annex ד' gives his school's level` IS
    IF `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m
    THEN JUST `the allowance annex ד' gives his school's level`
    ELSE NOTHING

`why a new principal's management allowance has no figure here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "סיכום הצדדים על הפרמטרים לקביעת רמת המורכבות של בית הספר ועל גמול הניהול של המנהל לפיה, שיצורף כנספח ד' להסכם (עד 31.12.2011)"

@ref akn:art_25__para_b
`days from the Oz signing to 5 Tevet 5772` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 14 8 2011)

`agreeing the principals' complexity levels` MEANS
    (PARTY `the employer`
     MUST  `agree the complexity-level parameters and the principal's management allowance`
     WITHIN `days from the Oz signing to 5 Tevet 5772`
     LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "§25(ב): the complexity-level parameters and the principal's management allowance are agreed by 31.12.2011")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the secondary teachers' organisation`
     MUST  `agree the complexity-level parameters and the principal's management allowance`
     WITHIN `days from the Oz signing to 5 Tevet 5772`
     LEST  BREACH BY `the secondary teachers' organisation` BECAUSE "§25(ב): the complexity-level parameters and the principal's management allowance are agreed by 31.12.2011")

§§ `25(ג)`

-- (ג): besides, a new principal serving in a school that applies the
-- reform in full is entitled to the Oz LaTmura supplement paid to
-- teachers, "בהתאם להוראות סעיף 16": 42% on the combined salary and the
-- 2001 and 2008 supplements, from the year the reform is applied in full
-- (§16(א)), a separate component counting for what §16(ב) lists.
@ref akn:art_25__para_c
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal` m e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    IF `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m
    THEN `the Oz LaTmura supplement for` e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement`
    ELSE 0

-- §16(ג) raises by 42% of their value on the eve of the signing the 1987
-- and 1994 supplements "המשולמות למורה כאמור בסעיף-קטן (א)", and a
-- principal is no "מורה" (§4(ב)). Whether (ג)'s referral to "the
-- provisions of §16" carries §16(ג) to the new principal is not said
-- (F-oz-founding-25-a). The reading adopted (convention reading.referral):
-- the referral brings in §16 whole, (ג) with it.
@ref akn:art_25__para_c
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER @desc the 1987 or the 1994 supplement as it would be paid without §16(ג)
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER @desc its shekel value on 13.8.2011
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a new principal's 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 25(ג)` m e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    IF `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m
    THEN `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 16(ג)` e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing`
    ELSE `the supplement without the increase`

§§ `25(ד)`

-- (ד): §18 applies to a new principal serving in a school that has applied
-- the reform, on the training allowance.
@ref akn:art_25__para_d
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 18 applies to a new principal in` y m e IF
        `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m
    AND `section 18 applies in` y e

§§ `25 -- illustrations`

-- A teacher of a four-year school who was first appointed its principal in
-- תשע"ג: no principal on either eve, and not first appointed in תשע"ב.
`a principal first appointed in 5773` MEANS
    `Oz staff member` WITH
        `as section 2 sees them`                    IS `a covered upper-division employee in` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`
        `teaches grades 10 to 14`                   IS TRUE
        `teaches grade 9`                           IS TRUE
        `serves as a school principal`              IS TRUE
        `appointed principal by the employer's rules` IS TRUE
        `standing on the eve of signing`            IS `teaching for one of the employers`
        `standing on the eve of moving to the reform` IS `teaching for one of the employers`
        `began with one of the employers in 5772 to 5775` IS FALSE
        `teaching years recognised for salary seniority` IS 0
        `of them an internship year`                IS 0
        `of them teaching in army or national service` IS 0
        `of them seniority for compulsory army or national service` IS 0
        `first appointed a principal in 5772`       IS FALSE
        `under the reform in 5772, fully or in part` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `a new principal under the Oz agreement` `a principal first appointed in 5773`
#ASSERT `a new principal's management allowance` `a principal first appointed in 5773` 3000 EQUALS JUST 3000
#ASSERT `a new principal's management allowance` (`a serving principal of` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`) 3000 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 42% of 20,700, in a school in full application; none in part
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in full` 20000 400 300 EQUALS 8694
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in part` 20000 400 300 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the Oz LaTmura supplement of a new principal` (`a serving principal of` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`) `the Oz reform in full` 20000 400 300 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `section 18 applies to a new principal in` `the school year 5773` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT `days from the Oz signing to 5 Tevet 5772` EQUALS 139

-- F-oz-founding-25-a's evidence: the new principal is no "מורה", whom
-- §16(ג) names, and on the reading adopted his 1994 supplement of 500 on
-- the eve, 520 since, is paid as 520 + 210.
`section 25(ג) carries section 16(ג) to one who is no teacher` MEANS
        NOT `a teacher under the Oz agreement` `a principal first appointed in 5773`
    AND `a new principal's 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 25(ג)` `a principal first appointed in 5773` `the Oz reform in full` 520 500 EQUALS 730
#ASSERT `section 25(ג) carries section 16(ג) to one who is no teacher`
